        "en": "Families frequently express appreciation for the caring and transparent guidance provided by the team, including Johnny Nessy. Buyers note that the staff treats them with warmth and takes time to match households with suitable breeds, such as hypoallergenic companions. Reviewers describe feeling comfortable and supported throughout the entire purchase."
