        "en": "Healthy companions with medical records"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report receiving lively and clean puppies, including Toy Poodles, Yorkies, Pomeranians, and Schnauzers. Customers appreciate that each puppy comes with vaccination paperwork and veterinary documentation. When one puppy experienced a minor parasite issue post-arrival, the business promptly covered the vet expenses until full recovery."
      }
