        "en": "Attentive follow-up after arrival"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise the ongoing communication maintained by the team long after puppies settle into new homes. Staff members check in via phone calls and text messages, answering care questions and reviewing feeding routines. Clients highlight how reassuring it is to have dependable access to advice during the initial transition period."
